Using S10/S20/S50 to keep architecture boundaries, Hydra config conventions, and artifact schema aligned.

Added `conf/wafer_particles/labels/taxonomy_v2.yaml` with coarse/family metadata and generator hints while preserving all v1 label names and expected_rules. Generate now derives `label_coarse`/`label_family` from taxonomy metadata (falls back to v1 category), and the samples schema marks those columns optional so QC/export/train remain backward compatible. QC taxonomy parsing now treats `coarse` as the category fallback, and docs/tests were updated to cover the new hierarchy.

